WEBVTT

00:00:08.168 --> 00:00:10.420
(SCREAMING CONTINUES)

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:21.765
Buster! It's falling! Let go!

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:35.069
(PANTING) Whoa! Whoa!

00:00:37.739 --> 00:00:39.324
(GRUNTING AND PANTING)

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:43.703
Okay, okay. Steady, girl. Steady.

00:00:45.705 --> 00:00:47.165
(GASPING)

00:01:01.012 --> 00:01:03.807
No, no, no!

00:01:04.432 --> 00:01:05.600
(COUGHING)

00:01:07.185 --> 00:01:08.186
(GROGGILY) Oh!

00:01:08.645 --> 00:01:09.687
(COUGHING)

00:01:09.813 --> 00:01:10.814
Ah! Is everyone okay?

00:01:11.064 --> 00:01:12.106
Nana!

00:01:13.316 --> 00:01:15.610
(STAMMERING) I'm so sorry! I just...

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:17.946
No, no, don't go!

00:01:18.029 --> 00:01:21.324
Has anyone seen my glass eye?

00:01:21.699 --> 00:01:22.659
Oh... (STUTTERS)

00:01:22.742 --> 00:01:24.369
It's right here, Miss Crawly. I've got it.

00:01:24.452 --> 00:01:25.662
(RUMBLING)

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:27.914
(CREAKING)

00:01:30.792 --> 00:01:31.835
BUSTER: Look out!

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:38.591
(COUGHING)

00:01:55.859 --> 00:01:56.901
No.

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:14.878
Oh, Dad.

00:02:14.961 --> 00:02:16.421
I'm so sorry.

00:02:19.465 --> 00:02:20.967
(SOBBING)

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:28.933
BOSS BEAR: Where is Mike?

00:02:29.392 --> 00:02:31.477
-(GASPS)
-He must be dead.

00:02:31.561 --> 00:02:33.021
Come on, let's go!

00:02:41.321 --> 00:02:42.989
PIGLET: Mommy, where are you?

00:02:43.865 --> 00:02:45.742
-PIGLETS: Help!
-Oh, my gosh!

00:02:45.992 --> 00:02:47.035
Help!

00:02:47.118 --> 00:02:48.912
Hold on! Mommy's here!

00:02:56.044 --> 00:02:58.212
NEWS REPORTER DOG: (ON TV)
I'm standing at the scene right now, Judy.

00:02:58.296 --> 00:02:59.672
And I can tell you,

00:02:59.756 --> 00:03:02.884
it is a miracle
anyone survived this unbelievable disaster.

00:03:20.735 --> 00:03:22.528
(INAUDIBLE)

00:03:39.128 --> 00:03:42.382
Yeah, Buster Moon certainly brought down
the house once and for all today.

00:03:42.465 --> 00:03:45.718
And although Mr. Moon
has not been available for questions,

00:03:45.802 --> 00:03:47.136
unconfirmed reports suggest

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:49.472
he was responsible for building a water tank

00:03:49.555 --> 00:03:51.808
that exploded and flooded the building.

00:03:51.891 --> 00:03:53.810
I've been told the 250 squid

00:03:53.893 --> 00:03:55.144
who had been part of
Moon's display are in fact...

00:03:55.269 --> 00:03:56.479
(KNOCKING ON DOOR)

00:03:56.562 --> 00:03:59.148
Eddie? There's someone at the door.

00:03:59.273 --> 00:04:00.650
(KNOCKING CONTINUES)

00:04:00.775 --> 00:04:02.193
And that none of them were
harmed during the incident.

00:04:02.276 --> 00:04:05.113
Whether they will be
returning to their usual work is not yet...

00:04:05.196 --> 00:04:06.698
(TV SWITCHES OFF)

00:04:06.823 --> 00:04:07.907
Oh, no.

00:04:08.574 --> 00:04:09.867
MISS CRAWLY: Mr. Moon?

00:04:11.995 --> 00:04:14.789
ASH: Come on, Moon. You can't just hide out
in your buddy's pool house.

00:04:14.872 --> 00:04:17.709
ROSITA: Yeah, we just wanna
make sure you're all right, that's all.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:23.047
-Hey, Mr. Moon.
-You okay?

00:04:23.131 --> 00:04:26.926
Guys, look. I'm sorry about what happened...

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:28.344
And the prize money and...

00:04:28.469 --> 00:04:29.929
ROSITA: Oh, it's okay.

00:04:30.013 --> 00:04:32.348
No. None of this is okay.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:33.975
At least we're all in one piece.

00:04:34.058 --> 00:04:35.226
Yeah, and you know what?

00:04:35.309 --> 00:04:37.895
I bet we can find
some other place to put the show on.

00:04:37.979 --> 00:04:39.439
-Right?
-ALL: Yeah!

00:04:39.522 --> 00:04:43.234
The show? Guys, I'm done.

00:04:45.111 --> 00:04:47.155
-Are you serious?
-What do you mean, "done"? Come on!

00:04:47.488 --> 00:04:49.449
Didn't you see this? Huh?

00:04:49.782 --> 00:04:52.493
Look, it says I'm a "danger to society."

00:04:52.577 --> 00:04:53.661
(ALL SCOFF)

00:04:53.745 --> 00:04:56.789
"A deluded, washed-up charlatan

00:04:56.873 --> 00:04:59.042
"who never had a hit in his career."

00:04:59.167 --> 00:05:01.002
Oh, come on, you don't believe all that?

00:05:01.294 --> 00:05:03.254
Yeah. I do.

00:05:03.504 --> 00:05:05.506
JOHNNY: Listen. You're not
the only one who lost something here.

00:05:05.965 --> 00:05:07.216
-We all did.
-GUNTER: Ja!

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:11.054
I mean, I lost any chance of ever speaking to
my dad again over this show.

00:05:11.137 --> 00:05:13.765
-Sorry.
-ROSITA: Oh, Mr. Moon, don't...

00:05:14.515 --> 00:05:15.725
JOHNNY: (SIGHS) Forget about it.

00:05:15.808 --> 00:05:17.852
GUNTER: What is this? I don't understand.

00:05:17.935 --> 00:05:19.395
ASH: Come on, let's get out of here.

00:05:23.191 --> 00:05:24.525
MEENA: Mr. Moon?

00:05:24.942 --> 00:05:26.486
Meena, please...

00:05:27.528 --> 00:05:29.739
I baked a cake for you 'cause...

00:05:29.822 --> 00:05:34.660
Well, I know you're sad right now
and probably afraid to try again and...

00:05:34.786 --> 00:05:35.995
Yeah, I am afraid.

00:05:36.412 --> 00:05:38.039
I'm afraid that this...

00:05:38.122 --> 00:05:39.874
This, me, right now, this is who I am.

00:05:39.957 --> 00:05:41.459
This is my lot for life.

00:05:41.542 --> 00:05:44.003
That I'm not the guy
that my dad wanted me to be.

00:05:44.087 --> 00:05:45.171
Not by a million miles.

00:05:45.296 --> 00:05:46.297
But you told me...

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:48.091
BUSTER: What? What did I say?

00:05:48.174 --> 00:05:49.217
Well, you know...

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.636
"Don't let fear stop you
from doing the thing you love."

00:05:51.719 --> 00:05:54.847
Ugh! That's just a bunch of stupid, corny...

00:05:54.931 --> 00:05:57.266
-No, it's not.
-What? You really believe

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:58.643
that you're gonna be a singer?

00:05:58.726 --> 00:05:59.769
Well, yeah, maybe...

00:05:59.936 --> 00:06:02.105
Well, then you're just as big a fool as I am!

00:06:04.107 --> 00:06:05.149
Look, kid...

00:06:05.274 --> 00:06:07.318
You and me, we're both

00:06:07.401 --> 00:06:08.820
afraid for good reason.

00:06:09.529 --> 00:06:10.863
'Cause deep down, we know...

00:06:11.447 --> 00:06:12.448
(SIGHS)

00:06:12.532 --> 00:06:14.367
We just don't have what it takes.

